From cb99ed712a9f8ee998b06123c90cf81d3b179373 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Musselmann <derek@disflux.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:49:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Matrix: run state, progress and spend in the agent
 protocol

The tool-progress bubble carries org.fluxchat.agent state "working" with
the latest step and the step count; the final reply carries "done" or
"failed" with the model, context use and the session's estimated spend;
when the run ends the adapter edits the bubble to the same final state.
Approval prompts name the run they hold up. Only adapters that declare
AGENT_STATUS (Matrix) get the metadata; others see no change.
